      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "To be honest, I have no idea how to spend my weekend.",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "老实讲，我真係唔知个周末可以点过。",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 4.464,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Right now I'm just lying around listening to this novel — I don't even know why I'm so hooked on it.",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 4.464,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "呢排净係瞓喺度听《雪中悍刀行》，连自己点解咁上瘾都唔知。",
          "start_time": 4.464,
          "end_time": 10.632000000000001,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "I've basically been lying around all day — not feeling great, and I don't really have the will to do anything else.",
          "start_time": 4.464,
          "end_time": 10.632000000000001,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "end_time": 16.968000000000004,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "基本上成日都係瞓喺度，状态麻麻哋，乜嘢都冇乜心机去做。",
          "start_time": 10.632000000000001,
